OpenFish v2.25.0 Cloudflare Worker release marker.

This dedicated path trigger deploys the Worker and static assets only after the
release is merged to main. Cloud Run Relay/Browser Engine deployment remains
separately gated by its required GCP and vault secrets.

Admin bootstrap UI patch: use separate custom username and custom password fields; do not reuse login field. Existing API validation and one-time bootstrap secret remain unchanged.

Internal fix: forward production bootstrap and vault secrets from Worker to Durable Object auth handler.
